      "writtenOn": "2024-03-16T15:11:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please reuse android.net.thread.ChannelMaxPower for ot-daemon.\n\nYou can do this by defining a aidl source file group in thread/framwork/Android.bp and include that source file group for ot-daemon-aidl, like this:\n\n```\n// thread/framework/Android.bp\n\nfilegroup {\n    name: \"framework-thread-ot-daemon-shared-aidl-sources\",\n    srcs: [\n        \"java/**/ChannelMaxPower.aidl\",\n    ],\n    path: \"java\",\n    visibility: [\n        \"//external/ot-br-posix:__subpackages__\",\n    ],\n}\n\n\n// external/ot-br-posix/src/android/aidl/Android.bp\n\naidl_interface {\n    name: \"ot-daemon-aidl\",\n\n    // This interface is private to only module \"com.android.tethering\"\n    unstable: true,\n    srcs: [\n        \"com/android/**/*.aidl\",\n        \":framework-thread-ot-daemon-shared-aidl-sources\",\n    ],\n    ......\n}\n```",
